---
import "../styles/landingpage/style.scss"
import ColourBand from "../components/ColourBand.astro"
import ShList from "../components/ShList.astro"
---

<html lang="en">
	<head>
		<meta charset="UTF-8" />
		<meta http-equiv="X-UA-Compatible" content="IE=edge" />
		<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
		<title>Yanwenyuan.uk</title>
		<link rel="icon" type="image/png" href="/icon.png" />
	</head>
	
	<body>
		<div class="cbox">
			<ColourBand></ColourBand>

			<h1>
				<img
					src="/ywy-full-compressed.svg"
					alt="燕文院"
					style="max-width: 240px; margin-bottom: -20px;"
				/>
			</h1>

			<p style="text-align: center; margin-top: -1.2em;">Yanwenyuan</p>

			<p>
				山上燕文院，閑書收集之處。陋頁存敝人燕某之作，亦收他書，再通友院。
			</p>

			<p>
				This is a landing page works by or collected by Yan. Most pages are in Chinese or Classical Chinese.
			</p>

			<ColourBand></ColourBand>

			<h2>
				<span class="title-icons icon-make" aria-hidden="true"></span>
				Creations
			</h2>

			<ul>
				<li>
					<a href="baoyu/">暴雨中：In Torrential Rains</a> (一篇玄幻故事；进行中)
				</li>
				<li>
					<a href="shenhai/"
						>神海大作集：Collections from the Celestial Sea</a
					>（竖排繁体文言短篇小说）
				</li>
			</ul>

			<h2>
				<span class="title-icons icon-translate" aria-hidden="true"></span>
				Translations
			</h2>

			<ul>
				<li>
					<a href="dagengren/"
						>大奉打更人：The Nightwatchers of Feng by 卖报小郞君</a
					> (ongoing, English translation)
				</li>
			</ul>

			<h2>
				<span class="title-icons icon-book" aria-hidden="true"></span>
				随意收罗的书籍
			</h2>
			
			<ul>
				<li>
					<a href="fengshen/">封神演义【明】许仲林</a>（简）
				</li>
				<li>
					<a href="shiji/">史記三家注【漢】司馬遷</a>
				</li>
				<li><a href="shishuo/">師說【唐】韓愈</a></li>
				<li>
					<a href="jimengyaojue/"
						>擊蒙要訣【清】李珥；自《栗谷先生全書》</a>
				</li>
				<li>
					<a href="/zhuangzijishi/"
						>莊子集釋【清】郭慶藩（特殊排版）</a>
				</li>
			</ul>

			<h2>
				<span class="title-icons icon-friend" aria-hidden="true"></span>
				友院
			</h2>

			<ul>
				<li>
					<a href="https://vistudium.top/">遠見齋</a> Hulenkius
				</li>
			</ul>

			<footer>

            <hr> 
            <p class="small">
				本网者由（Astro）所成，尝试之而颇好其理。全站燕某所设。
            </p>

        </footer>
		</div>
	</body>

	<style>
		.title-icons {
			display: inline-block;
			width: 50px;
			height: 50px;
			margin-bottom: 0px;
			vertical-align: middle;

			background-color: #3a6342;

			-webkit-mask-repeat: no-repeat;
			-webkit-mask-position: center;
			-webkit-mask-size: contain;

			mask-repeat: no-repeat;
			mask-position: center;
			mask-size: contain;
		}

		.icon-make {
			-webkit-mask-image: url("/assets/make.png");
			mask-image: url("/assets/make.png");
		}

		.icon-translate {
			-webkit-mask-image: url("/assets/translate.png");
			mask-image: url("/assets/translate.png");
		}

		.icon-book {
			-webkit-mask-image: url("/assets/book.png");
			mask-image: url("/assets/book.png");
		}

		.icon-friend {
			-webkit-mask-image: url("/assets/friend.png");
			mask-image: url("/assets/friend.png");
		}
	</style>
</html>
